// verify_manifest.test — kernscope-verify corpus gate (todo 35).
//
// Runs kernscope-verify --json over EVERY corpus kernel named in the
// consolidated tests/verify/manifest.json and diffs the emitted verdicts
// against the manifest's expected_verdict entries (live read at test time;
// anti-self-report: the CLI never sees the manifest). Any mismatch FAILS
// naming the kernel.
//
// REQUIRES: no-gpu
//
// RUN: %python %S/verify_manifest.py --cli %kernscope-verify \
// RUN:     --corpus %S/corpus --manifest %S/manifest.json
